  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-06T03:10:21.743Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So like years ago I requested for Tagalog to be added in the language list because of the number of Filipinos playing VRChat during the Pandemic, and I thank you guys for adding Filipino on the language list.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-ph-tagalog\n\nHowever there are 2 languages added that may cause confusion among people, FIL and TGL.\n\nI've talked to a lot of Filipinos and even Foreign Filipino friends to provide me their input.\n\nFilipino (FIL) is what you call the language that comes from the Philippines and Tagalog (TGL) is just one of the languages that come from the Philippines.\n\nThe correct term is Filipino and the language code should be FIL\n\nPlease remove Tagalog(TGL) , Thank you.",
